### 1. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. 创建会员（创建）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"测试会员","phone":"13900009999","gender":"女","birthday":"2000-01-01"}

### 3. 查询会员列表（查询）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members

### 4. 为会员办卡（创建）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/2/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardType":"TIMES","startDate":"2026-10-23","endDate":"2027-10-23","remainingTimes":50}
